msgstr "sudo（``/etc/sudoers.d/qubes``）："

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:21 ceeccd93891b462abf82b720a215009e
msgid "Easy user -> root access (main option for the user)."
msgstr "輕鬆的使用者 -> root 存取（使用者的主要選項）。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:23 b4262e126ca6423db4b500741aea2bb6
msgid "``qvm-usb`` (not really working, as of R2)."
msgstr "``qvm-usb``（截至 R2 版本實際上無法正常運作）。"

#: ../../../developer/system/vm-sudo.rst:27 89c9d9d6c7394b378214fcfdb2f9e4cc
